  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Fantasy**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **Stallion 5**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **Daisies**: back after 84 archived shows (1067 days); rare: 7 archived performances [6]\n- **Wavin' My Dick**: back after 51 archived shows (752 days) [6]\n- **Pandy**: back after 126 archived shows (1507 days); rare: 6 archived performances [6]\n- **Goin Gets Tough**: back after 53 archived shows (786 days); rare: 4 archived performances [6]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Monique the Freak [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2005-10-03** (recommended): source not stated; 32 songs; 158 min; rated 4.67/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Shotgun microphones give a closer-to-the-stage sound than the FOB recording of the same show, according to this listener; Reviewer says the sound quality is about one step below an FM broadcast feed; Reviewer finds the room sound at the new Higher Ground excellent, and the recording captures it well [3][4][5]\n- **Ween2005-10-03.schoeps**: source not stated; 32 songs; 158 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Band played straight through without a set break, according to this reviewer, who attended the previous night's show [5]\n- Venue has permanent microphones hanging from the ceiling for tapers, plus AC power; a person named Wade works there [1]\n- Uploader parked an RV in front of the venue overnight, having asked permission, since they attend school across the lake [1]\n- Nobody taped the previous night's show, which the reviewer attended; this one is considered equally good [5]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2005-10-03**: taped by taper420; source: ROC 5', SOB, PAS, Sennheiser me66 shotguns > Samson Mixpad 4 > Sony Rh10 Hi-MD@16bit/44.1kHZ [1]. Also: Recording credited to JesseF, who taped and shared it; Uploader believes they were the only taper at this show [1][4]",
